<view class="page {{role}} "><view wx:if="{{denied}}" class="denied">{{denied}}<button class="primary" bindtap="home">返回首页</button></view><block wx:else><view class="heading-title">为好生意，储备好权益</view><view class="subtitle">{{role==='agent'?'向平台采购，入账后可供名下商户购买。':'卖方由当前商户归属确定，平台代收。'}}</view><view class="note" style="margin-top:25rpx">模拟支付不会真实扣款。权益仅在后端模拟支付确认后入账，不依赖客户端支付提示。</view><view class="card product" wx:for="{{products}}" wx:key="id"><view class="product-tag">{{item.tag}}</view><view class="card-title">{{item.name}}</view><view class="product-quantity">{{item.quantity}}<text>注权益</text></view><view class="row"><text class="price">¥ {{item.displayPrice}}</text><button class="primary small" bindtap="buy" data-id="{{item.id}}" loading="{{busy}}" disabled="{{busy}}">模拟购买</button></view></view></block></view>